EO-WM builds on Open-Sora 2.0 (https://github.com/hpcaitech/Open-Sora)
and includes a modified EO-VAE package (https://github.com/nilsleh/eo-vae).
Original copyright and third-party notices are retained in LICENSE and
the corresponding source files. Public author and maintainer attribution
in upstream package metadata is retained.

The code/ distribution adapts these projects for EarthNet2021 forecasting,
weather conditioning, cumulative stress features, and benchmark evaluation.
Release preparation also adjusts configuration loading, portable paths,
environment installation, and command-line launchers.

EarthNet2021 data and externally downloaded model weights remain subject
to their respective original terms.

